Cell["\<\
Comment to off-ribbon unweighted mean after GDF vs off-ribbon \
exposure-weighted mean after GDF: this HP version and the rectangular-grid \
version are different discretizations, so their GDF baselines and sample \
counts do not have to match exactly.\
\>", "Text",
